public class Trie{class N{public N[]c=new N[26];public bool end;}N r=new();public Trie(){}public void Insert(string w){N p=r;foreach(char x in w){int k=x-'a';if(p.c[k]==null)p.c[k]=new N();p=p.c[k];}p.end=true;}public bool Search(string w){N p=r;foreach(char x in w){p=p.c[x-'a'];if(p==null)return false;}return p.end;}public bool StartsWith(string w){N p=r;foreach(char x in w){p=p.c[x-'a'];if(p==null)return false;}return true;}}
